Ankle, Ankle, Ankle! Heel, Heel, Heel! Thumb, Thumb, Thumb! Knuckle, Knuckle, Knuckle!

39
00:01:57.184 --> 00:01:59.604
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:00.617 --> 00:02:18.175
Let's learn small parts of the body! Your eyebrows are above your eyes, and your eyelashes protect them. Bend your elbow and turn your wrist. Show me your thumb! Knock on the door with your knuckles. Your ankle is between your foot and your leg, and your heel is at the back of your foot.

41
00:02:18.475 --> 00:02:20.951
